# Nitrogen · N · gate 7

**Nitrogen** (N) is element **7** of the periodic table — a **reactive nonmetal**, period 2, group 15, p-block, gas at standard conditions, atomic weight **14.007**.

## The element (carbon layer — reference chemistry)
78% of the air; inert as gas, violent as nitrate; the fertilizer that feeds the world.

